  + [MRF-028] production exposes supplied-data parsing normalization hashing candidate generation exact reconstruction comparison witness serialization and independent verification only and performs no filesystem environment clock process network provider model inference MCP Git workspace secret permission activation remote hardware or external action
  + [MRF-029] first retained fixture is synthetic provider-free with two jobs eight hints two exact recovery sources four accepted releases one drift refusal one underdetermined refusal a four-hint final basis and zero effects; its values prove mechanics only
